# OverTheWire Bandit — Levels 0–13

## Overview

I used OverTheWire Bandit to strengthen my Linux command-line, file-system, permissions, SSH, text-processing, and basic security problem-solving skills.

Bandit is structured as a series of progressively harder Linux challenges. Each level provides a practical problem that requires identifying information in the environment and using Linux tools to obtain the credentials required for the next level.

I completed the challenges through the Bandit 13 stage.

> Environment: Authorized educational CTF environment

